@* design/components/GoalStats (slice-6 state, HP-001, HP-004, HP-005, research R-12): the eyebrow and the title, then
   three ht-stat boxes in the design's order: "Consistency" with the consistency as one whole ReportText text
   ("90% (18 of 20)" or "N/A"; ht-stat__value--text), "Streak, {unit}" and "Longest, {unit}" (the plural unit from
   ReportText) with the streaks as numbers, then the ConsistencyStrip of the given states with its legend. One
   component for the goal page ("This attempt", "Consistency and streaks") and the visitor Home's example card
   ("Example goal" and the goal's title); it computes no figure and builds no figure text. *@
@using System.Globalization
@using HT.Application.Reports
@using HT.Domain.Evaluation
@using HT.Domain.Reports
<section class="ht-card">
    <div class="ht-eyebrow">@Eyebrow</div>
    <h2 class="ht-card__title">@Title</h2>
    <div class="ht-stats">
        <div class="ht-stat"><div class="ht-stat__value ht-stat__value--text">@View.ConsistencyText</div><div class="ht-stat__label">Consistency</div></div>
        <div class="ht-stat"><div class="ht-stat__value">@View.CurrentStreak.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)</div><div class="ht-stat__label">@ReportText.StreakLabel(Unit)</div></div>
        <div class="ht-stat"><div class="ht-stat__value">@View.LongestStreak.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)</div><div class="ht-stat__label">@ReportText.LongestLabel(Unit)</div></div>
    </div>
    <ConsistencyStrip States="Strip" Unit="Unit" />
</section>

@code {
    /// <summary>The goal's figures with their texts.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public GoalStatsView View { get; set; } = null!;

    /// <summary>The strip's ended results (Met, Failed, Missed, Excused, Paused or Pending), oldest first.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public IReadOnlyList<EvaluationState> Strip { get; set; } = [];

    /// <summary>The goal's streak unit, which the labels and the strip's label name.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public StreakUnit Unit { get; set; }

    /// <summary>"This attempt" on the goal page, "Example goal" on the visitor Home.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Eyebrow { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>"Consistency and streaks" on the goal page, the example goal's title on the visitor Home.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Title { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}
